  "term": "medical home",
  "definition": "In this historical usage, a medical home is a residential place where a patient can be removed from ordinary domestic surroundings and cared for under nursing supervision during treatment. It is described as offering more oversight than private lodgings, because the patient is also under the supervision of the home's manager.",
